title: $:/plugins/linonetwo/memeloop-agent-ui/readme
caption: MemeLoop Agent UI
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

This example embeds the reusable `@memeloop/react-ui` Agent shell in TiddlyWiki through `tw-react`.

Open [[MemeLoop Agent]] for the full view, or use the //MemeLoop// sidebar tab. Both mount the same shared `AgentSessionController`/`AgentChatShell`, keep at most 50 messages and 256 KiB resident, and use revision-safe absolute timeline seeks. The example exposes agent, model and execution-target selection, typed configuration actions, prompt preview and the shared scheduled-task editor. Dragging one or more TiddlyWiki tiddlers into either view atomically adds them to the next message as Wiki attachments.

The same widget follows the Wiki language direction and light/dark palette. Container queries collapse its controls for the narrow sidebar without maintaining a second UI implementation. If the Electron host is unavailable, it fails closed with a localized configuration action instead of calling missing services.

To bind a specific conversation:

```
<$memeloopAgentChat agentId="your-agent-instance-id" mode="full" />
```
